yaml/string
description: Text in one of five concretes — plain, quoted, or block
- >
  A string comes in five concretes — the bare **plain** style, the two quoted ones, and the
  two block ones. See the subchapters below:
- !!<format: text/x-yaml> |
  a: plain text
  b: 'single quoted'
  c: "double\tquoted"
  d: |
    literal block
  e: >
    folded block
- *: 00-yaml_string_plain
- *: 01-yaml_string_single_quoted
- *: 02-yaml_string_double_quoted
- *: 03-yaml_string_literal_block
- *: 04-yaml_string_folded_block
